{"id":"5457c0fe86b8ee21","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-filter2-boolean-ultrafilter.md","title":"ZFC Filter2 Boolean Ultrafilter","display":"df-zfc-filter2-boolean-ultrafilter — ZFC Filter2 Boolean Ultrafilter","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-filter2-boolean-ultrafilter","aliases":["58-df-zfc-filter2-boolean-ultrafilter"],"display":"df-zfc-filter2-boolean-ultrafilter — ZFC Filter2 Boolean Ultrafilter","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-filter2-boolean-ultrafilter"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-filter2-boolean-ultrafilter</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-filter2-boolean-ultrafilter — ZFC Filter2 Boolean Ultrafilter"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a5e10857074b912e\" href=\"?note=a5e10857074b912e\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra\">../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B\">\\(\\mathbb B\\)</span> (Boolean-algebra carrier, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a5e10857074b912e\" href=\"?note=a5e10857074b912e\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra\">../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\wedge_{\\mathbb B},\\vee_{\\mathbb B},\\neg_{\\mathbb B},0_{\\mathbb B},1_{\\mathbb B}\">\\(\\wedge_{\\mathbb B},\\vee_{\\mathbb B},\\neg_{\\mathbb B},0_{\\mathbb B},1_{\\mathbb B}\\)</span> (Boolean-algebra operations and bounds)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_{\\mathbb B}\">\\(\\leq_{\\mathbb B}\\)</span> (order induced by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\leq_{\\mathbb B}b\\leftrightarrow a\\wedge_{\\mathbb B}b=a\">\\(a\\leq_{\\mathbb B}b\\leftrightarrow a\\wedge_{\\mathbb B}b=a\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\subseteq\\mathbb B\">\\(U\\subseteq\\mathbb B\\)</span> (ultrafilter candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Boolean}\">\\(\\mathrm{Boolean}\\)</span> (Boolean-algebra predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a5e10857074b912e\" href=\"?note=a5e10857074b912e\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra\">../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter2BooleanUltrafilter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFilter2BooleanUltrafilter}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter2\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}ultrafilter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter2BooleanUltrafilter}_S(U,\\mathbb B,\\wedge_{\\mathbb B},\\vee_{\\mathbb B},\\neg_{\\mathbb B},0_{\\mathbb B},1_{\\mathbb B})\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Boolean}(\\mathbb B,\\wedge_{\\mathbb B},\\vee_{\\mathbb B},\\neg_{\\mathbb B},0_{\\mathbb B},1_{\\mathbb B})\\land U\\subseteq\\mathbb B\\land 1_{\\mathbb B}\\in U\\land 0_{\\mathbb B}\\notin U\\land \\forall a,b\\in U\\;(a\\wedge_{\\mathbb B}b\\in U)\\land \\forall a\\in U\\;\\forall b\\in\\mathbb B\\;((a\\wedge_{\\mathbb B}b=a)\\to b\\in U)\\land \\forall b\\in\\mathbb B\\;(b\\in U\\lor \\neg_{\\mathbb B}b\\in U)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter2\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}ultrafilter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter2BooleanUltrafilter}_S(U,\\mathbb B,\\wedge_{\\mathbb B},\\vee_{\\mathbb B},\\neg_{\\mathbb B},0_{\\mathbb B},1_{\\mathbb B})\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Boolean}(\\mathbb B,\\wedge_{\\mathbb B},\\vee_{\\mathbb B},\\neg_{\\mathbb B},0_{\\mathbb B},1_{\\mathbb B})\\land U\\subseteq\\mathbb B\\land 1_{\\mathbb B}\\in U\\land 0_{\\mathbb B}\\notin U\\land \\forall a,b\\in U\\;(a\\wedge_{\\mathbb B}b\\in U)\\land \\forall a\\in U\\;\\forall b\\in\\mathbb B\\;((a\\wedge_{\\mathbb B}b=a)\\to b\\in U)\\land \\forall b\\in\\mathbb B\\;(b\\in U\\lor \\neg_{\\mathbb B}b\\in U)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n<li>Every Boolean operation and bound is truth-relevant and therefore occurs in the public signature; the induced order is expanded by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\wedge b=a\">\\(a\\wedge b=a\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"a5e10857074b912e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"a5e10857074b912e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbb B$ (Boolean-algebra carrier, see [[../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"a5e10857074b912e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Boolean}$ (Boolean-algebra predicate, see [[../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb B","display":false},{"tex":"\\wedge_{\\mathbb B},\\vee_{\\mathbb B},\\neg_{\\mathbb B},0_{\\mathbb B},1_{\\mathbb B}","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_{\\mathbb B}","display":false},{"tex":"a\\leq_{\\mathbb B}b\\leftrightarrow a\\wedge_{\\mathbb B}b=a","display":false},{"tex":"U\\subseteq\\mathbb B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Boolean}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter2BooleanUltrafilter}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter2\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}ultrafilter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter2BooleanUltrafilter}_S(U,\\mathbb B,\\wedge_{\\mathbb B},\\vee_{\\mathbb B},\\neg_{\\mathbb B},0_{\\mathbb B},1_{\\mathbb B})\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Boolean}(\\mathbb B,\\wedge_{\\mathbb B},\\vee_{\\mathbb B},\\neg_{\\mathbb B},0_{\\mathbb B},1_{\\mathbb B})\\land U\\subseteq\\mathbb B\\land 1_{\\mathbb B}\\in U\\land 0_{\\mathbb B}\\notin U\\land \\forall a,b\\in U\\;(a\\wedge_{\\mathbb B}b\\in U)\\land \\forall a\\in U\\;\\forall b\\in\\mathbb B\\;((a\\wedge_{\\mathbb B}b=a)\\to b\\in U)\\land \\forall b\\in\\mathbb B\\;(b\\in U\\lor \\neg_{\\mathbb B}b\\in U)","display":true},{"tex":"a\\wedge b=a","display":false}],"bytes":1738,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1886","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-filter2-boolean-ultrafilter.md|58-df-zfc-filter2-boolean-ultrafilter]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","a5e10857074b912e"]}